    <string name="full_description">CallsBlocker is an app for intelligent blocking of incoming calls. It allows you to create a personalized blacklist with:\n\n• Total block (rejects and sends busy signal)\n• Silence (mutes without rejecting)\n• Whitelist (allows call through)\n\nSupports both exact numbers and wildcard prefixes to block entire families of numbers.</string>
